    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tv4i](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tv4i) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 03 2026 66km SE of Tuluá. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 3.7386 longitude -75.7198. It impacted 87857 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
